# YT6 — NDA Deployment Constraints Overview

## 1. Purpose
This document introduces the **deployment constraints** inside the NDA layer of YT6.  
Deployment constraints define the boundaries, rules and conditions required for safe, stable and correct integration of YT6 into partner environments.

This overview does not expose any protected deployment mechanics.

